{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_115_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "f8b7afeb9ba59fb6c4d063ba31f989bc535dcf8d39c2e612b569c564fefa8c85", "ja": "杏奈も……何か、飲みたい……。\n{$P$}さん……お茶、しよう……？", "zh": "杏奈也……想喝点什么……  \n{$P$}先生……一起喝茶……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
